opt/indi-stable/lib/*.so.*

# Alignment-subsystem math plugins. These belong in -libs rather than -dev
# despite their unversioned .so names: they are dlopen'd MODULEs, not
# link-time libraries. libs/alignment/MathPluginManagement.cpp opendir()s the
# directory, readdir()s it and dlopen()s each entry at runtime, so a
# runtime-only install without them enumerates zero math plugins and degrades
# silently rather than failing.
#
# The entry is explicit because dh_install's globs are not recursive: neither
# lib/*.so.* here nor lib/*.so in -dev matches a subdirectory, so these were
# staged but unpackaged and dh_missing failed the build. The RPM %files
# section hit the identical failure -- see core/rpm/indi-stable-core.spec.
opt/indi-stable/lib/indi/MathPlugins/*.so
